# FOLIAGE-PT-TRANSMISSION: the near hedge, the cypresses and the awning of the Bistro night: MegaLights against the path tracer. The exposure is fixed in every frame (the automatic one answers the method).
# Numbers, linear luminance, every frame averaged in 4x4 blocks, 0_ml and 2_level against 1_pt: hedge L +-15 %, cv +-15 %, clip <= 0.5 %, blk <= PT + 3 pp, R/G +-10 %; cypress L +-25 %, blk <= PT + 5 pp; awning L +-30 %, blk <= PT + 10 pp; wall L +-10 %; Laplace energy of the hedge in 0_ml >= 0.8 of 1_pt. MegaLights passes <= base + 0.6 ms, VRAM <= base, 0 validation errors.
# Side by side: [0_ml | 1_pt | 2_level], crop (.28,.20)-(.67,1.0), the brightness untouched.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GI_Bistro_Night.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Дано run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent 100"
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.AutoExposure false
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ManualExposureEV100 0.5260688
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method Stochastic"
Когда frames 120
Тогда-вид 0_ml MegaLights, the GI of the level
Тогда [0_ml]: the hedge is sharp and not burnt out, the cypresses and the awning are lit as in 1_pt, no coloured spots, no white outline
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Off"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 64"
Когда frames 200
Тогда-вид 1_pt the path tracer, the reference
Тогда [1_pt]: the cypress glows through its leaves, no fireflies
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method Level"
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид 2_level the picture of the scene and the level, nothing overridden
Тогда [2_level]: the hedge keeps the leaf contrast and the leaf colour of 1_pt, the awning is red from below, not black
